  "title": "Relationship integrity",
  "summary": "SpiceDB v1.36.0 introduces a new feature: relationship integrity. It ensures that all relationships written to the backing datastore are signed by a key only known to SpiceDB, protecting your SpiceDB permissions system from modifications to their relationship data.",
